	•	Backend should support full-text search or fuzzy search using optimized methods (e.g., Elasticsearch, MySQL full-text, or in-memory search).
	6.	Accessibility and Role Handling:
	•	The visibility of results should respect the user’s role:
	•	Tenant-level users should only see tenant-relevant data.
	•	Superadmins should see everything.
	•	Normal users may only see their own or allowed entities.

